{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of Extinct VR, an immersive single-player action-adventure and exploration VR experience that transports you to a bizarre realm filled with strange occurrences and challenging obstacles. In Extinct VR, you step into the shoes of an ordinary man thrust into extraordinary circumstances, navigating through a captivating universe where every corner hides new mysteries.                 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/explore.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter unique life forms reminiscent of cyborgs remnants of an advanced civilization that has faced its downfall. As you delve deeper into this enigmatic world, you\u2019ll face a series of puzzles and formidable foes, each with their own tactics and weaknesses.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/Creature.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/Cpanel.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the freedom of movement with both free locomotion and teleportation mechanics, allowing you to explore your surroundings and interact with the environment in unprecedented ways. Extinct VR also has a mode with a seated play feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/Teleport.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us on this thrilling journey where courage, wit, and resourcefulness are your greatest allies. Will you uncover the secrets of Extinct VR and survive its many trials?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nature Protector ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/d456779202132ce07bd2842923c9cfe9fc9c2f3b.jpg"},{"name":"Fixer ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/bbb1bde70720285f52eb6e8ef8e195deb4431163.jpg"},{"name":"No Cynophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/3d675ecb7b3561cd18b02f116c947058f6efeddf.jpg"},{"name":"Breaveheart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/c5d1a55bdded4a49d1d606e7b47cabf469abf6f2.jpg"},{"name":"Mathematician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/b7777ffde6a7ddfbf24f14cd1a327d1fee304543.jpg"},{"name":"Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/62a63d56b8661c7ef52b14a507ff5344162c9597.jpg"},{"name":"Terminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/e6ae3ce42cb48e18dc5d8dfe504f0eb3364b7560.jpg"},{"name":"Nazar Remover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/4df56c74c94286a93597b83083e88a6859d1823d.jpg"},{"name":"Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3179710/f78fa44b6b3da8341425a4891af823f30012f35b.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179710?t=1739206964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3179710?t=1739206964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/f86ed548a94348e87365652e0cf4716fadc42ac4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739206964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/f86ed548a94348e87365652e0cf4716fadc42ac4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739206964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Includes violence and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the world of Extinct VR, an immersive single-player action-adventure and exploration VR experience that transports you to a bizarre realm filled with strange occurrences and challenging obstacles. In Extinct VR, you step into the shoes of an ordinary man thrust into extraordinary circumstances, navigating through a captivating universe where every corner hides new mysteries.                 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/explore.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter unique life forms reminiscent of cyborgs remnants of an advanced civilization that has faced its downfall. As you delve deeper into this enigmatic world, you\u2019ll face a series of puzzles and formidable foes, each with their own tactics and weaknesses.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/Creature.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/Cpanel.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the freedom of movement with both free locomotion and teleportation mechanics, allowing you to explore your surroundings and interact with the environment in unprecedented ways. Extinct VR also has a mode with a seated play feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179710/extras/Teleport.gif?t=1739206964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us on this thrilling journey where courage, wit, and resourcefulness are yo